## Running the Project

Open 5 separate terminals:

**Terminal 1 — ngrok**
```powershell
cd "C:\Users\LENOVO\Desktop\nlp project\MeetingSummarizer\backend"
.\ngrok.exe http 8000
```

**Terminal 2 — Django**
```powershell
cd "C:\Users\LENOVO\Desktop\nlp project\MeetingSummarizer\backend"
venv\Scripts\activate
python manage.py runserver
```

**Terminal 3 — Celery Worker**
```powershell
cd "C:\Users\LENOVO\Desktop\nlp project\MeetingSummarizer\backend"
venv\Scripts\activate
celery -A config worker -l info --pool=solo
```

**Terminal 4 — Celery Beat**
```powershell
cd "C:\Users\LENOVO\Desktop\nlp project\MeetingSummarizer\backend"
venv\Scripts\activate
celery -A config beat -l info
```

**Terminal 5 — Frontend**
```powershell
cd "C:\Users\LENOVO\Desktop\nlp project\MeetingSummarizer\frontend"
npm run dev
```

Start them in order 1 → 5.

